config USB_STV06XX
	tristate "STV06XX USB Camera Driver"
	depends on USB_GSPCA
	help
	  Say Y here if you want support for cameras based on
	  the ST STV06XX chip.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the
	  module will be called gspca_stv06xx.
